# CODEOWNERS
# Required reviewers for changes. Branch protection on `main` and the
# `main-protection` ruleset currently require 1 approving review; this file
# lets GitHub auto-request the right human when CODEOWNERS review is enabled.
#
# Format: <pattern> <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Last match wins, so order from broad to specific.

# Default owner for everything in this repository.
/                                   @rebuildup

# Skill files: any change that adds, removes, or edits a Skill must be
# reviewed by the writing-skills maintainer.
/skills/                             @rebuildup
/templates/                          @rebuildup

# Repository workflow, infrastructure, and protection changes require
# maintainer review.
/.github/                            @rebuildup
/docs/                               @rebuildup

# Root agent contract and delivery-model documentation.
/AGENTS.md                           @rebuildup
/README.md                           @rebuildup
/CONTRIBUTING.md                     @rebuildup
/LICENSE                             @rebuildup